    {
        "content": "<p>With <code>pp.all</code> on, you can see that the goal after <code>ext</code> contains a universe metavariable <code>?u.10</code> as well as <code>v</code>, so this universe metavariable can potentially resolve to something other than <code>v</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">⊢</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Eq</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Map</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toFun</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">10</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">✝</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Map</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toFun</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">10</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">✝</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>but after <code>ext _</code> it has been resolved to <code>v</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">⊢</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Eq</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Map</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toFun</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">✝</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Map</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toFun</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">✝</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 625598005,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1789941763
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>In general declarations which look like <code>ext_max</code> above are problematic, because if you know that <code>max u v = u</code> then you cannot solve for <code>v</code>. So I would say that arguably the problem is that <code>ext_max</code> is a bad theorem.  Indeed if you change the type signature to <code>theorem ext_max {α : Type u} {β : Type v} ...</code> then things are fine.</p>",
        "id": 625598265,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1789941971
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>That makes the problem subtle. The ext theorem <code>Rep.hom_ext</code> has no universe parameter of shape <code>max{u v}</code>. <code>pp.all</code> is useful and locates the problematic universe</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">noncomputable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">indCoindNatIso</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">indFunctor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">subtype</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≅</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">coindFunctor</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">subtype</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">NatIso</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofComponents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rep</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">indCoindIso</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- without specifying `w` that the bare `indCoindIso A` produces `indCoindIso.{?u.41, u, v}` in the goal</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">indFunctor_obj</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">coindFunctor_obj</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">indFunctor_map</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">coindFunctor_map</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- now we don't need `ext _`</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">indCoindIso</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">indToCoindAux_comm</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 625645526,
        "sender_full_name": "Jiaxi Mo",
        "timestamp": 1789971307
    },
    {
